WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.104 --> 00:00:05.191
Untick Stay in overview: follow and heading become available.

2
00:00:06.409 --> 00:00:09.950
With heading on, the map turns to look at the track from the side.

3
00:00:11.762 --> 00:00:17.962
The camera stays locked on the point, at a scale of one to five hundred, and the track is drawn as it goes.
